// Links, images, and cross-references.

--- link ---
#link("https://example.com")[Example]
│ <p><a href="https://example.com">Example</a></p>

--- link-with-markup ---
#link("https://example.com")[an *emphatic* link]
│ <p><a href="https://example.com">an <strong>emphatic</strong> link</a></p>

--- image ---
#image("cat.png")
│ <p><img src="cat.png" alt=""></p>

--- image-with-alt ---
#image("cat.png", alt: "A sleeping cat")
│ <p><img src="cat.png" alt="A sleeping cat"></p>

--- image-inline ---
Look at #image("cat.png") — cute.
│ <p>Look at <img src="cat.png" alt=""> — cute.</p>

--- ref ---
= Intro <intro>

See @intro.
│ <h1 id="intro">Intro</h1>
│ <p>See <a href="#intro">intro</a>.</p>

--- ref-with-supplement ---
= Intro <intro>

See @intro[the *first* section].
│ <h1 id="intro">Intro</h1>
│ <p>See <a href="#intro">the <strong>first</strong> section</a>.</p>

--- link-destination-is-not-rewritten ---
// The destination is escaped and otherwise written as the document wrote it.
#link("?a=1&b=2")[query]
│ <p><a href="?a=1&amp;b=2">query</a></p>
